{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "```python\ndef change_base(x: int, base: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Changes numerical base of input number x to base. Returns its string representation.\n    Assumes base is an integer between 2 and 9, inclusive.\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return '0'\n\n    is_negative = False\n    if x < 0:\n        is_negative = True\n        x = -x\n\n    digits = []\n    while x > 0:\n        digits.append(str(x % base))\n        x //= base\n\n    result = \"\".join(reversed(digits))\n    if is_negative:\n        return '-' + result\n    return result\n```"}
