{"task_id": "HumanEval/48", "solution": "```python\ndef is_palindrome(text: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given string is a palindrome.\n    The check is case-sensitive and considers all characters.\n    >>> is_palindrome('')\n    True\n    >>> is_palindrome('aba')\n    True\n    >>> is_palindrome('aaaaa')\n    True\n    >>> is_palindrome('zbcd')\n    False\n    \"\"\"\n    i, j = 0, len(text) - 1\n    while i < j:\n        if text[i] != text[j]:\n            return False\n        i += 1\n        j -= 1\n    return True\n```"}
